{"severity":"error","file":"errors/pid_serialize_1.march","start_line":19,"start_col":9,"end_line":19,"end_col":13,"message":"`Hello` cannot derive Json, because its field `from` holds a `Pid`.\nA local pid names an actor on this node only; on another node it would name whatever runs in that slot there.","code":"pid_serialize","fix":null,"labels":[{"file":"errors/pid_serialize_1.march","start_line":18,"start_col":17,"end_line":18,"end_col":21,"message":"`from` holds the pid"}],"notes":["Carry a `GlobalPid.Pid` (node id, local pid, creation) in `Hello` instead; it is a plain record and derives Json."],"category":"ACTOR"}
